From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tinco Andringa <tinco@phusion.nl>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 16:16:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Include the amalgamated header via Passenger's include
 path

src/cxx_supportlib/vendor-modified is on Passenger's include path, so the
header is reached as <jsoncpp/json.h> rather than "json/json.h".
---
 jsoncpp.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/jsoncpp.cpp b/jsoncpp.cpp
index 93922a3..8c2caf3 100644
--- a/jsoncpp.cpp
+++ b/jsoncpp.cpp
@@ -73,7 +73,7 @@ license you like.



-#include "json/json.h"
+#include <jsoncpp/json.h>

 #ifndef JSON_IS_AMALGAMATION
 #error "Compile with -I PATH_TO_JSON_DIRECTORY"
